OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FAfter his beloved grandfather
OL,10,     Fdied, Rishab Sharma was broken by
OL,11,     Fgrief. He started playing his
OL,12,     Fsitar online, while talking openly
OL,13,     Fabout mental health - and became a
OL,14,     Fsensation.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1985 American gorilla expert
OL,17,     FDian Fossey was murdered in her
OL,18,     Fcabin at the research station she
OL,19,     Festablished in the mountains of
OL,20,     FRwanda.
